    "shirase (news: ii shirase ga kita)"
   ],
   "flags": [],
   "use": "The everyday way to ask or report whether someone got in touch: renraku kita? (did they get in touch?), mada renraku konai (still nothing from them), with ga dropped. The sender takes kara: kare kara renraku kita.",
   "notes": "renraku kitara oshiete = let me know if you hear from them.",
   "example": {
